<title>UK: Vodafone H1 pretax profits rise 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Vodafone H1 pretax profits rise 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)	    5.67		     vs 4.39</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)     2.36		     vs 1.97</p>
<p> Pretax		   252.4		    vs 208.1</p>
<p> Turnover		 771.5		    vs 666.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast Vodafone Group, the UK's biggest mobile phone group, would post pre-tax profits of 220 to 250 million stg before an exceptional credit of about 10 million stg for asset disposals. A dividend of between 2.26 and 2.36p was expected.</p>
</text>
